/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:999:front.shopping.delivery_modal.combined.li2: "Please enter the Order ID of the order you wish to combine in the notes field and select [Combined Shipping] as your shipping method."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1001:front.shopping.delivery_modal.combined.note1: "※Combined shipping is not available if any of the orders to be combined use Credit Card, Cash on Delivery, or Convenience Store Payment."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1003:front.shopping.delivery_modal.combined.note3: "※If you request combined shipping for a 4th or more order, we will combine up to the 3rd order, and combined shipping for the 4th order onwards will not be available."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1004:front.shopping.delivery_modal.combined.note4: "※Combined shipping is not available for orders that include pre-order items."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1008:front.shopping.payment_modal.deadline.body: "Payment is due by 15:00 (JST) on the 7th day after the order date.<br>If the due date falls on a holiday for financial institutions, the deadline will be 15:00 on the next business day.<br>-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-<br>Example: If ordered on April 1, the deadline is 15:00 on April 7.<br>(If April 7 is a Sunday, the deadline is 15:00 on April 8.)<br>-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-<br>※Orders past the payment deadline will be cancelled. If your payment will be delayed, please contact us in advance."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1022:front.shopping.payment_modal.credit.notes: "Your credit card statement will show \"Hareruya\" as the merchant name.<br>※Installment payments are not supported. Only lump-sum payment is available.<br>※We cannot change payment methods from other options to credit card.<br>※Combined shipping is not available for orders paid by credit card."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1023:front.shopping.payment_modal.cod.title: "●Cash on Delivery<br>Cash on delivery is available via Japan Post. The cash on delivery fee is based on the total payment amount (product price + shipping + COD fee) as follows.<br>※We cannot change payment methods from other options to cash on delivery.<br>-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1029:front.shopping.payment_modal.cod.notes: "-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-<br>※Cash on delivery is a payment method where the delivery carrier collects payment upon delivery.<br>※Please pay the total amount (including shipping and COD fee) in cash to the delivery carrier.<br>※If a package is not received and returned after the holding period, an additional shipping fee may be charged.<br>※An additional COD fee applies on top of the standard shipping fee.<br>※Shipping will be via Yu-Pack.<br>※Combined shipping is not available for orders using cash on delivery."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1036:front.shopping.payment_modal.convenience.notes: "Please pay at the selected convenience store.<br>※Payment procedures differ by store — please refer to your order confirmation email for details.<br>※We cannot change payment methods from other options to convenience store payment.<br>※Combined shipping is not available for orders using convenience store payment."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1039:front.shopping.payment_modal.bank.info: "Bank: MUFG Bank (Mitsubishi UFJ Bank)<br>・Branch: Takadanobaba Branch (053)<br>・Account type: Ordinary<br>・Account number: 0472843<br>・Account name: Kabushiki Gaisha Hareruya (KABUSHIKI GAISHA HARERUYA)"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1041:front.shopping.payment_modal.postal.info: "Postal transfer payment is available.<br>・Account number: 10100-30613341<br>・Account name: Ka) Hareruya"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1048:front.shopping.remarks.combined_note: "If you select [Combined Shipping] as the shipping method, please enter the \"Order ID\" of the order you wish to combine in the notes field."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1056:front.shopping.otc_notice.li2: "The item hold period is until %date%. Orders will be automatically cancelled after this date."
