/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1089:front.shopping.reserve_return_modal.return.nonconformity.condition.body1: "We inspect and describe product conditions on our product pages based on our own standards, taking into account the nature of used goods, in order to provide customers with an accurate understanding of item condition. Detailed condition standards are available on a separate page."
